  "summary": "As a Software Developer at Applied Research Solutions, I apply my expertise in deep neural networks (DNN) and machine learning (ML) algorithms to create innovative and impactful solutions in the computer vision domain. I have been working in this role for over four years, and I have contributed to multiple projects that involve researching, developing, and testing ML models and systems. I have also collaborated with other developers, researchers, and clients to ensure the quality and effectiveness of the solutions. I graduated from Earlham College in 2019 with a Bachelor's degree in Computer Science, where I developed a strong foundation in programming, data structures, algorithms, and software engineering. I am passionate about applying my skills and knowledge to solve real-world problems and to advance the field of artificial intelligence. I am always eager to learn new technologies and techniques, and to improve my competencies and performance. I value teamwork, innovation, and excellence, and I strive to deliver high-quality results and customer satisfaction.",
